EmpireBox canonical root marker.

This file proves the surrounding directory is the ACTIVE canonical
repo (~/empire-repo-main). Read by canonical_path.resolve_canonical_root()
to refuse paths that resolve to anywhere else.

The stale fork (~/empire-repo/) MUST NOT have this file. If it ever
gains one through a botched clone, canonical_path.resolve_canonical_root()
will misidentify that tree as canonical — this file is the single point
of truth.

If you find yourself editing this file's content for any reason other
than updating the token below, stop. The token is rotated only by the
canonical-repo-eradication dispatch — and the dispatch requires
freshly generating the file after the stale tree is removed.
